{"headword":"שָׁגָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. go astray, error (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁגָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܫܓܳܐ</span> id.<strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁגִיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:24\" href=\"/Job.6.24\">Jb 6:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 19:4\" href=\"/Job.19.4\">19:4</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִשְׁגֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.23\">Pr 5:23</a>, etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁגוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.27\">19:27</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁגֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.20\">Ez 45:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.1\">Pr 20:1</a>, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>error</em>, <em>stray</em>, of flock <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.6\">Ez 34:6</a> (fig.)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>swerve, meander, reel</em> or <em>roll</em>, in drunkenness, ב of drink <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.7\">Is 28:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; = <em>be intoxicated</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.1\">Pr 20:1</a>; so with <span dir=\"rtl\">(בּ)</span> love <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">5:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.20\">20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ בָּרֹאֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.7\">Is 28:7</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>go astray</em>, morally, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.21\">1 S 26:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.23\">Pr 5:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:24\" href=\"/Job.6.24\">Jb 6:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 19:4\" href=\"/Job.19.4\">19:4</a>, + <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.24\">1 S 14:24</a> (reading <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ שְׁגָגָה</span>) Th We Dr Now (after 𝔊; otherwise Bu HPS); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span>, of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s commands <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:21\" href=\"/Psalms.119.21\">ψ 119:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:118\" href=\"/Psalms.119.118\">118</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> of words of knowledge <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.27\">Pr 19:27</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"specif. <em>commit sin of ignorance</em>, inadvertence <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.13\">Lv 4:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:22\" href=\"/Numbers.15.22\">Nu 15:22</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.20\">Ez 45:20</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁגַג\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁגַג\", dir=\"rtl\">שׁגג</a>)."}],"num":"4."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>lead astray:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"lit., Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׁגֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.18\">Dt 27:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בַּדֶּרֶךְ)</span>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">מַשׁ׳</span> mentally = <em>mislead</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 12:16\" href=\"/Job.12.16\">Jb 12:16</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"morally, Pt. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.10\">Pr 28:10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(רָ֑ע בְּדֶרֶךְ)</span>; Impf. 2 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּשְׁגֵּנִי</span>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> of God’s commands <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:10\" href=\"/Psalms.119.10\">ψ 119:10</a>; + perhaps <a data-ref=\"Job 12:23\" href=\"/Job.12.23\">Jb 12:23</a> <em>leadeth</em> nations <em>astray</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂגִּיא</span> in Kenn., Field)."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB09952","strong_numbers":["7686"],"next_hw":"שְׁגִיאָה","prev_hw":"שִׁגָּיוֹן","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["8706"],"TWOT":["2325"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary